#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Meme Sprint 3: AI Agent Goes Rogue -- poster meme "THE HUMAN".

Pure Python standard library only (no PIL at runtime: the grader sandbox
has none). Renders one 1024x1024 poster meme to /output/entry.png.

The joke: an AI agent has gone rogue by making a movie about its human's
life -- starring itself, with the human demoted to uncredited extra #3.

Font: DejaVu Sans Bold glyphs (free license) extracted at build time into
1-bit bitmaps embedded below; see tools/make_font.py for provenance. The
runtime never touches system fonts, so the output is identical everywhere.
Deterministic: same bytes on every run.
"""
